        </header>

        <div class="category-bar">
            <!-- <<< 已修正: data-category 使用唯一的英文键 >>> -->
            <button class="category-btn active" data-category="all">全部道具</button>
            <button class="category-btn" data-category="consumable">消耗品类</button>
            <button class="category-btn" data-category="functional">功能类</button>
            <button class="category-btn" data-category="special">特殊服务类</button>
        </div>

        <div class="main-content">
            <div class="item-list" id="item-list-container"></div>
            <div class="item-detail-wrapper" id="item-detail-wrapper">
                <div class="detail-placeholder" id="detail-placeholder">
                    <p>正在加载道具信息...</p>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-error" id="detail-error" style="display: none;">
                    <p>解析数据失败。<br>请检查AI回复内容与格式是否正确。</p>
                </div>
